{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026caoiefcV621791116596.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">巴西舉行總統選舉。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">首輪投票將於本港時間明早八時結束，爭取連任的總統盧拉到票站投票，今次選舉被視為他同前總統博爾索納羅長子弗拉維奧的對決。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">民調顯示兩人支持度接近，預料要到月底的次輪投票，才能分出勝負。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T13:38:47.221281+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}